WEBVTT

00:00:00.600 --> 00:00:06.600
We will now begin tonight's semifinal, the OPBF Featherweight Title Match!

00:00:09.110 --> 00:00:10.360
In the red corner,

00:00:10.700 --> 00:00:17.830
the OPBF Featherweight Champion, Miyata Ichirou!

00:00:20.080 --> 00:00:26.420
In the blue corner, the third-ranked featherweight boxer, Medgoen Dutchboy!

00:00:26.420 --> 00:00:29.060
Miyata, win it for us!

00:00:27.760 --> 00:00:30.070
And make it quick!

00:00:29.060 --> 00:00:32.340
Ichirou-kun, good luck!

00:00:30.580 --> 00:00:32.340
Kill him with your counter!

00:00:32.940 --> 00:00:34.980
We've got no info on this guy.

00:00:34.980 --> 00:00:37.940
Use the first round to feel him out.

00:00:38.950 --> 00:00:39.930
What is it?

00:00:40.820 --> 00:00:42.990
You'll know him when you see him.

00:00:47.160 --> 00:00:49.160
Mr. Sakaguchi?

00:00:54.990 --> 00:00:56.720
Mr. Sakaguchi.

00:00:57.560 --> 00:01:02.730
Former manager for the previous OPBF Featherweight Champion, Arnie Gregory.

00:01:02.730 --> 00:01:09.110
But we were the ones who robbed them of that belt.

00:01:09.110 --> 00:01:13.630
I see. So he's back for revenge, is he?

00:01:13.630 --> 00:01:16.690
In that case, you better treat his fighter like he's your assassin.

00:01:16.690 --> 00:01:18.050
Watch yourself out there!

00:01:18.050 --> 00:01:20.000
Okay, Dad.

00:01:20.660 --> 00:01:22.630
<i>I won't relinquish my belt,</i>

00:01:22.630 --> 00:01:24.750
<i>no matter who I fight!</i>

00:01:26.450 --> 00:01:29.070
There goes the opening bell!

00:01:29.070 --> 00:01:32.010
This is Miyata Ichirou's fourth OPBF title defense!

00:01:32.720 --> 00:01:35.650
The champion possesses a world-class counter!

00:01:35.650 --> 00:01:39.530
When will we see him unsheathe his father's weapon?

00:01:39.530 --> 00:01:42.020
Also, how good is the opponent he's facing?

00:01:43.040 --> 00:01:45.520
Will Medgoen Dutchboy make a good run for the belt?

00:01:46.670 --> 00:01:49.030
Or will the champion, Miyata Ichirou, cut him down?

00:01:49.490 --> 00:01:52.030
How will the two fighters kick off this match?

00:01:52.030 --> 00:01:53.410
He's close enough to punch!

00:01:53.410 --> 00:01:55.160
Will the challenger go in?

00:01:55.160 --> 00:01:57.530
Do it! You'll just get his counter!

00:01:59.240 --> 00:02:01.330
<i>I don't sense him coming after me at all.</i>

00:02:02.020 --> 00:02:04.740
<i>Is he that wary of my counter?</i>

00:02:05.420 --> 00:02:07.500
This is a long stare-down.

00:02:07.500 --> 00:02:09.160
Quiet.

00:02:09.160 --> 00:02:13.130
<i>He's keeping himself in check along with Miyata, 
who definitely knows when he's in punching distance.</i>

00:02:13.630 --> 00:02:16.300
<i>That challenger is something else!</i>

00:02:16.730 --> 00:02:19.510
<i>The challenger is obviously waiting for the first move.</i>

00:02:19.510 --> 00:02:23.300
<i>I myself wouldn't go in, but I'm sure Miyata-kun will.</i>

00:02:23.300 --> 00:02:25.560
<i>That's just how he is!</i>

00:02:26.280 --> 00:02:28.790
<i>An anti-counter strategy?</i>

00:02:28.790 --> 00:02:32.900
<i>Let me see how well you've worked it out!</i>

00:02:34.930 --> 00:02:36.450
What lightning speed!

00:02:36.450 --> 00:02:38.620
The champion's left shatters the ambient silence!

00:02:38.620 --> 00:02:41.260
Those flashes of light blasts the challenger backwards!

00:02:42.740 --> 00:02:44.110
The challenger is dumbfounded!

00:02:44.110 --> 00:02:46.310
He loses sight of the champion for a second!

00:02:46.310 --> 00:02:48.460
That's what world-class speed looks like!

00:02:48.460 --> 00:02:52.510
Wow! That jab must be his meal ticket!

00:02:52.510 --> 00:02:54.800
His hand speed isn't the only thing to watch for.

00:02:55.410 --> 00:02:58.800
There are only a few boxers who can literally disappear right before your eyes!

00:03:00.890 --> 00:03:03.090
<i>He never ceases to amaze me.</i>

00:03:03.090 --> 00:03:03.890
<i>That man...</i>

00:03:06.260 --> 00:03:10.440
<i>will go even faster just when you think he's going at top speed.</i>

00:03:25.080 --> 00:03:27.240
The entire arena is mesmerized.

00:03:27.240 --> 00:03:29.230
Even I can't take my eyes away!

00:03:29.950 --> 00:03:32.940
<i>Miyata-kun's a better boxer each time he fights.</i>

00:03:32.940 --> 00:03:37.220
<i>But... I never imagined he'd box this well!</i>

00:03:37.880 --> 00:03:40.220
Those bolts of lightning don't let up!

00:03:40.980 --> 00:03:44.000
Will it be a matter of time before he breaks through the guard?

00:03:44.520 --> 00:03:46.810
Ow! Ow! That hurts, Tomiko!

00:03:46.810 --> 00:03:50.520
Your face is all swollen! My poor Macharu!

00:03:50.730 --> 00:03:51.860
Sensei!

00:03:51.860 --> 00:03:55.850
Huh? What gives? Is Miyata done with his match?

00:03:55.850 --> 00:03:58.470
Yes, Miyata-kun, you blow my mind.

00:03:58.470 --> 00:04:00.740
But he's nothing compared to you.

00:04:00.740 --> 00:04:02.270
Got that right!

00:04:01.140 --> 00:04:02.270
Actually...

00:04:02.270 --> 00:04:03.660
...he's not getting anywhere.

00:04:04.520 --> 00:04:05.580
What?!

00:04:08.380 --> 00:04:09.330
Tired?

00:04:09.330 --> 00:04:10.670
Not yet.

00:04:11.260 --> 00:04:15.600
<i>He's certainly gotten into his rhythm, and is fighting on his own terms.</i>

00:04:15.600 --> 00:04:18.760
<i>I can see him lasting till the final round.</i>

00:04:19.810 --> 00:04:23.040
<i>He doesn't hit. His guard is as tight as a turtle's.</i>

00:04:23.040 --> 00:04:26.310
<i>The challenger isn't taking any clean hits.</i>

00:04:26.730 --> 00:04:31.560
<i>What's the meaning behind that overly restrained strategy?</i>

00:04:32.510 --> 00:04:34.930
Remember all that money I gave you?

00:04:34.930 --> 00:04:37.020
Now work it off like your life depends on it!

00:04:39.200 --> 00:04:40.070
Box!

00:04:48.260 --> 00:04:50.910
<i>Body blows won't get him to let up his guard?</i>

00:04:50.910 --> 00:04:53.380
<i>He only wants to protect his face?</i>

00:04:54.130 --> 00:04:56.630
<i>Let him hit as many body blows as he wants.</i>

00:04:57.050 --> 00:05:01.420
<i>But if he gets your face and you black out, it'll be all for nothing.</i>

00:05:05.800 --> 00:05:07.230
<i>It's pretty solid.</i>

00:05:07.230 --> 00:05:11.940
<i>But I'll show you how much power a bunch of skinny arrows bunched together can pack!</i>

00:05:19.060 --> 00:05:20.320
A triple left jab!

00:05:20.320 --> 00:05:22.320
He blasted through that tight guard!

00:05:22.860 --> 00:05:25.080
<i>He hit the same exact spot several times!</i>

00:05:25.080 --> 00:05:27.130
Don't get hit, Medgoen!

00:05:31.580 --> 00:05:34.130
The challenger responds in kind for the first time!

00:05:34.130 --> 00:05:36.590
And what a solid hit that was!

00:05:37.230 --> 00:05:39.340
<i>That short hook was tight and to the point.</i>

00:05:39.340 --> 00:05:41.090
<i>That's a nice weapon you have.</i>

00:05:41.560 --> 00:05:46.100
<i>That hook looked more like a hatchet. And compact to boot.</i>

00:05:46.100 --> 00:05:49.100
<i>It'll make it very difficult to use any counters.</i>

00:05:49.700 --> 00:05:51.640
I was wondering what he had up his sleeve.

00:05:51.640 --> 00:05:54.100
It turned out to be that punch.

00:05:54.720 --> 00:05:57.460
<i>The challenger was using the first few rounds to size him up.</i>

00:05:57.460 --> 00:05:59.610
<i>Now he'll be going on the offensive!</i>

00:06:01.170 --> 00:06:07.120
Whoa! Instead of attacking, the challenger steps back and turtles up again!

00:06:07.770 --> 00:06:10.370
<i>Yes, that's all you have to do.</i>

00:06:10.960 --> 00:06:14.230
<i>Okay, what should I do with this?</i>

00:06:14.230 --> 00:06:16.490
<i>It's one thing if you don't think you can win.</i>

00:06:16.490 --> 00:06:22.640
<i>But if you're not willing to fight, 
it only pisses me off even if I win!</i>

00:06:24.170 --> 00:06:26.020
The champion closes in!

00:06:26.020 --> 00:06:29.850
He puts himself within shooting range of the challenger's deadly punch!

00:06:31.430 --> 00:06:32.310
Now he's infighting!

00:06:32.310 --> 00:06:35.350
The champion's slugging him from all directions!

00:06:35.870 --> 00:06:37.980
That is simply unbearable!

00:06:38.550 --> 00:06:41.190
But the challenger isn't putting down his guard!

00:06:44.430 --> 00:06:47.570
<i>No, you can die right here for all I care.</i>

00:06:47.570 --> 00:06:50.160
<i>Just make sure you work off your debt till the final round!</i>

00:06:55.160 --> 00:06:56.360
<i>Daddy...</i>

00:06:57.680 --> 00:07:00.460
<i>Daddy... Daddy...</i>

00:07:00.460 --> 00:07:01.560
<i>Maria!</i>

00:07:02.290 --> 00:07:03.920
<i>Dammit!</i>

00:07:04.930 --> 00:07:06.380
<i>What a pity!</i>

00:07:06.380 --> 00:07:09.510
<i>Your daughter will die if she doesn't get help.</i>

00:07:10.850 --> 00:07:12.270
<i>Mr. Sakaguchi!</i>

00:07:12.750 --> 00:07:15.220
<i>But you can't afford to take her to a doctor?</i>

00:07:16.220 --> 00:07:18.820
<i>P-Put me in a match!</i>

00:07:18.820 --> 00:07:20.770
<i>I don't care who I fight!</i>

00:07:21.260 --> 00:07:26.070
<i>I will fight whoever I face heroically and brilliantly!</i>

00:07:26.490 --> 00:07:29.060
<i>Heroically? Brilliantly?</i>

00:07:29.060 --> 00:07:30.630
<i>No need for that.</i>

00:07:31.630 --> 00:07:33.320
<i>What are you saying?</i>

00:07:35.240 --> 00:07:38.540
<i>I want to find out more about this man.</i>

00:07:39.140 --> 00:07:41.670
<i>And you're going to show me everything.</i>

00:07:43.110 --> 00:07:48.060
<i>You're known for your toughness in the Muay Thai circuit and I've come to purchase it.</i>

00:07:48.060 --> 00:07:53.560
<i>All you have to do is remain upright for the full 12 rounds, so that I can know everything about him.</i>

00:07:54.290 --> 00:07:55.920
<i>Are you telling me...</i>

00:07:55.920 --> 00:07:58.690
<i>to become a human sandbag?</i>

00:07:59.050 --> 00:08:04.690
<i>I won't give you time to think it over. You will decide here and now.</i>

00:08:05.040 --> 00:08:09.360
<i>Will you sacrifice your own life or 
watch your precious daughter die?</i>

00:08:10.030 --> 00:08:13.240
<i>Make your choice.</i>

00:08:14.450 --> 00:08:17.000
A body shot! That had to leave a mark!

00:08:17.000 --> 00:08:22.210
<i>I thought I was able to tough it out against any opponent!</i>

00:08:22.210 --> 00:08:23.750
<i>But this is too much!</i>

00:08:24.490 --> 00:08:26.010
<i>He's too strong!</i>

00:08:26.670 --> 00:08:28.260
The champion won't let him escape!

00:08:28.720 --> 00:08:31.470
<i>He's deliberately putting himself in the danger zone!</i>

00:08:31.470 --> 00:08:35.520
<i>I know what that fist is saying!</i>

00:08:36.170 --> 00:08:38.520
<i>“Let's slug it out and settle this fight!”</i>

00:08:39.290 --> 00:08:41.810
A right! The challenger's body twists around!

00:08:42.300 --> 00:08:44.670
<i>What an outstanding champion.</i>

00:08:44.670 --> 00:08:47.320
<i>This man is a real boxer.</i>

00:08:48.700 --> 00:08:52.530
<i>But as for me... as for me...</i>

00:08:58.800 --> 00:09:00.850
<i>Make your choice.</i>

00:09:11.630 --> 00:09:16.300
<i>I'm actually proud that I'm making money for my daughter.</i>

00:09:16.300 --> 00:09:22.150
<i>But pulling punches in the ring is the most shameful thing imaginable!</i>

00:09:22.590 --> 00:09:25.650
Impossible! What is he trying to do?!

00:09:26.170 --> 00:09:29.900
<i>I choose to fight this strong champion,</i>

00:09:30.570 --> 00:09:33.440
<i>and die like a true boxer!</i>

00:09:37.450 --> 00:09:42.320
Hey! Is he bleeding from his mouth?! Is he having that much trouble?!

00:09:42.320 --> 00:09:45.860
You saw him take that punch? Ain't he in trouble?

00:09:45.860 --> 00:09:47.500
He did put up a guard,

00:09:47.500 --> 00:09:50.270
but the challenger still drew blood when he hit him.

00:09:50.270 --> 00:09:52.010
And that was <i>with</i>  the guard up?

00:09:52.010 --> 00:09:56.470
You're telling me the challenger is that powerful?

00:09:56.470 --> 00:10:00.480
No wonder you can cut the tension in the arena with a knife.

00:10:00.480 --> 00:10:02.170
<i>No.</i>

00:10:02.170 --> 00:10:05.510
<i>The challenger has now switched into fighting mode.</i>

00:10:05.510 --> 00:10:10.030
<i>Miyata-kun saw that and is now on very high alert.</i>

00:10:10.650 --> 00:10:13.490
<i>That's what is making everybody so tense.</i>

00:10:14.490 --> 00:10:15.950
<i>If his opponent attacks,</i>

00:10:16.550 --> 00:10:20.330
<i>Miyata-kun can end this match in an instant...</i>

00:10:21.070 --> 00:10:22.690
<i>with his counter.</i>

00:10:34.840 --> 00:10:36.930
The challenger breaks the ice!

00:10:36.930 --> 00:10:39.430
Is he getting impatient? This is a full-frontal assault!

00:10:39.430 --> 00:10:40.830
Are you stupid?

00:10:40.830 --> 00:10:44.440
Any headlong attack against Miyata is suicidal!

00:10:45.310 --> 00:10:46.230
<i>It's coming!</i>

00:10:47.860 --> 00:10:49.110
Wow, he's quick!

00:10:49.110 --> 00:10:52.820
The high-speed short hooks are raining from both sides!

00:10:52.820 --> 00:10:54.570
<i>That guy is definitely...</i>

00:10:54.570 --> 00:10:56.100
...a tough nut to crack.

00:10:56.100 --> 00:10:57.100
Yeah.

00:10:57.100 --> 00:10:59.950
Miyata may be able to pull off a counter,

00:11:00.410 --> 00:11:04.120
but the speed of that back and forth means a slugfest is just as likely.

00:11:04.540 --> 00:11:07.650
It's like sticking your hand inside a cyclone.

00:11:07.650 --> 00:11:09.880
It looks just like Ippo's Dempsey Roll.

00:11:13.890 --> 00:11:16.930
<i>Medgoen, you're throwing more
 punches than I gave you credit for.</i>

00:11:17.380 --> 00:11:19.430
<i>In that case, make one of them count.</i>

00:11:19.760 --> 00:11:21.060
<i>Now hit him!</i>

00:11:24.600 --> 00:11:28.690
<i>Despite all those blows, he made a clean counter against one of them!</i>

00:11:28.690 --> 00:11:30.680
There's our counter!

00:11:30.680 --> 00:11:33.190
The challenger's knees are buckling!

00:11:34.910 --> 00:11:36.400
But he regains his footing!

00:11:36.990 --> 00:11:38.200
<i>Was it too light?</i>

00:11:38.690 --> 00:11:41.580
He's making another headlong attack!

00:11:43.010 --> 00:11:46.830
The champion counters every one of those strikes!

00:11:49.290 --> 00:11:52.230
<i>Medgoen's movements are not that slow.</i>

00:11:52.230 --> 00:11:56.050
<i>You're telling me that Miyata still sees them in slow motion?</i>

00:11:57.550 --> 00:11:59.250
<i>He's strong.</i>

00:11:59.250 --> 00:12:02.060
<i>I knew that all along. But...</i>

00:12:02.060 --> 00:12:06.560
<i>I will be heroic and brilliant to the end!</i>

00:12:07.100 --> 00:12:09.610
<i>This guy is unusually tough.</i>

00:12:09.610 --> 00:12:11.270
<i>In both body and mind.</i>

00:12:11.690 --> 00:12:16.320
<i>But... I will cut off your final lifeline with this next blow!</i>

00:12:20.450 --> 00:12:22.580
<i>He's changed it up to a straight!</i>

00:12:22.580 --> 00:12:25.500
<i>Miyata-kun is too used to seeing side punches!</i>

00:12:25.500 --> 00:12:27.460
<i>Yes, we've got him!</i>

00:12:27.460 --> 00:12:29.790
<i>At least one strike!</i>

00:12:31.620 --> 00:12:34.590
<i>My god... he dodged that?!</i>

00:12:34.590 --> 00:12:38.340
<i>He can't even touch him anymore?</i>

00:12:38.800 --> 00:12:40.340
<i>Wow...</i>

00:12:40.340 --> 00:12:42.600
<i>Don't give up until the end!</i>

00:12:47.480 --> 00:12:49.300
He's cut him down!

00:12:49.300 --> 00:12:52.310
With his secret weapon, the Cross Counter!

00:12:50.250 --> 00:12:51.010
Down!

00:12:52.310 --> 00:12:53.500
One!

00:12:54.230 --> 00:12:55.460
Two!

00:12:56.260 --> 00:12:57.260
Three!

00:12:57.140 --> 00:12:59.270
<i>How pathetic.</i>

00:12:58.470 --> 00:12:59.470
Four!

00:12:59.270 --> 00:13:02.810
<i>I shouldn't have given him half the fight money upfront.</i>

00:13:00.580 --> 00:13:02.030
Five!

00:13:02.710 --> 00:13:03.920
Six!

00:13:02.810 --> 00:13:04.580
<i>Now it's down the toilet!</i>

00:13:07.120 --> 00:13:11.580
Oh my gosh! He's up! What a tough fighter!

00:13:12.580 --> 00:13:15.340
<i>I can tell that something is keeping him in the fight.</i>

00:13:15.340 --> 00:13:19.340
<i>That challenger will not bow down, not while he's still conscious.</i>

00:13:19.870 --> 00:13:22.720
<i>If he saw that, he'd never let me live it down.</i>

00:13:22.720 --> 00:13:25.430
<i>Weak! Weak! Weak! Weak!</i>

00:13:25.430 --> 00:13:26.740
<i>But what did you expect?</i>

00:13:26.740 --> 00:13:28.870
<i>It's still not perfect.</i>

00:13:29.540 --> 00:13:32.190
<i>I'm thankful that you're still standing.</i>

00:13:32.190 --> 00:13:34.610
<i>I'm starting to get a feel for it now.</i>

00:13:35.740 --> 00:13:38.360
<i>Guess we're going to dance some more.</i>

00:13:39.190 --> 00:13:41.630
<i>What a cool stare he has.</i>

00:13:41.630 --> 00:13:44.560
<i>But I could tell from trading punches with him...</i>

00:13:44.560 --> 00:13:47.710
<i>that his fury is raging deep within him.</i>

00:13:47.710 --> 00:13:50.000
<i>You never know what will happen in a boxing match.</i>

00:13:50.000 --> 00:13:52.540
<i>But nothing is happening for me.</i>

00:13:52.540 --> 00:13:55.900
<i>I know all that, and recognize that death may very well await me,</i>

00:13:55.900 --> 00:13:58.930
<i>but his fury is still stirring me up!</i>

00:13:58.930 --> 00:14:03.560
<i>I just hope I can return to my own country and tell my daughter...</i>

00:14:05.230 --> 00:14:06.180
<i>that I...</i>

00:14:13.810 --> 00:14:16.110
<i>But if you tuck in your left arm,</i>

00:14:18.070 --> 00:14:20.360
<i>it stretches your back muscles.</i>

00:14:27.480 --> 00:14:33.370
<i>...fought heroically against a powerful champion!</i>

00:14:37.610 --> 00:14:39.180
Maria!

00:14:40.850 --> 00:14:43.010
Shouldn't you be asleep?

00:14:43.010 --> 00:14:45.380
Thanks for worrying about me, Chana.

00:14:45.380 --> 00:14:47.050
But I'm fine.

00:14:47.050 --> 00:14:48.140
Really?

00:14:49.710 --> 00:14:52.560
Is... his match over?

00:14:54.810 --> 00:14:58.490
My daddy was so excited about his first title match.

00:14:59.220 --> 00:15:01.570
He said he'll come back as the champion.

00:15:02.500 --> 00:15:03.650
Say, Chana...

00:15:04.880 --> 00:15:07.900
Is the champion Ichirou Miyata strong?

00:15:07.900 --> 00:15:09.910
You know about him, don't you?

00:15:11.810 --> 00:15:14.670
Yeah, Ichirou is really strong.

00:15:14.670 --> 00:15:17.040
Even now I look up to him.

00:15:17.840 --> 00:15:21.550
I've never seen any boxer throw that kind of counter.

00:15:25.340 --> 00:15:26.180
Sorry, Maria!

00:15:26.180 --> 00:15:27.550
Uh-

00:15:27.550 --> 00:15:30.170
I don't want a belt!

00:15:30.170 --> 00:15:32.340
I just want him to come home safe.

00:15:33.010 --> 00:15:36.810
I want him to play with me again, now that I'm healthy.

00:15:46.880 --> 00:15:50.780
A Cross Counter! And the ref calls the match!

00:15:50.780 --> 00:15:56.290
The challenger hits the mat after 
receiving that secret weapon again!

00:15:56.290 --> 00:15:59.220
So he walks away without taking a clean hit?

00:15:59.220 --> 00:16:04.010
This wasn't close at all! It's like he's wolfing down another cream puff!

00:16:04.010 --> 00:16:08.370
Wow! You can always count on Ichirou's counters!

00:16:10.420 --> 00:16:14.990
<i>That was certainly a Miyata-kun win,
 but something was off.</i>

00:16:14.990 --> 00:16:17.020
<i>Was it his timing? His punching?</i>

00:16:18.030 --> 00:16:22.520
<i>I can't put my finger on it, but there's 
something different about his counter.</i>

00:16:22.880 --> 00:16:24.500
That was terrible.

00:16:24.500 --> 00:16:25.490
You think so?

00:16:25.490 --> 00:16:28.600
It was too blunt, because I was thinking about it too much.

00:16:28.600 --> 00:16:30.130
Don't sweat it.

00:16:30.130 --> 00:16:33.230
Just take the win and go home.

00:16:33.230 --> 00:16:36.460
Uh-oh! The challenger isn't moving at all!

00:16:36.460 --> 00:16:37.960
There has been a massive loss of blood!

00:16:38.270 --> 00:16:40.170
Out of the way! Let us through!

00:16:41.460 --> 00:16:46.210
<i>He was a stupid man all right, but at least he was useful in one way.</i>

00:16:46.660 --> 00:16:50.350
<i>I discovered a flaw in Miyata's boxing.</i>

00:16:50.350 --> 00:16:54.260
<i>All in all, I'd say I got a good return.</i>

00:16:55.990 --> 00:16:57.270
He's awake!

00:16:57.270 --> 00:16:59.230
Put him carefully on the stretcher!

00:16:59.770 --> 00:17:01.130
Don't talk, Medgoen!

00:17:01.130 --> 00:17:03.230
Don't move your head!

00:17:06.750 --> 00:17:09.530
<i>Nothing to say to the loser?</i>

00:17:09.530 --> 00:17:12.280
<i>He's a boxer to the core.</i>

00:17:16.000 --> 00:17:17.200
Miyata!

00:17:20.150 --> 00:17:22.920
<i>Xya bhae.</i>

00:17:26.290 --> 00:17:28.210
I heard him say something.

00:17:28.210 --> 00:17:30.350
You know Thai, don't you?

00:17:30.350 --> 00:17:31.720
Enough to get by.

00:17:32.740 --> 00:17:34.460
<i>Xya bhae.</i>

00:17:34.460 --> 00:17:35.720
<i>“Don't lose.”</i>

00:17:36.740 --> 00:17:38.600
<i>I have no intention of ever losing.</i>

00:17:39.670 --> 00:17:41.390
<i>No matter who I fight!</i>

00:17:41.390 --> 00:17:43.950
Dammit! You're so awesome, Miyata!

00:17:43.950 --> 00:17:45.390
Look at me!

00:17:45.390 --> 00:17:46.900
You're invincible in the Oriental-Pacific!

00:17:47.270 --> 00:17:49.170
Drop the title and take on the world!

00:17:49.170 --> 00:17:51.400
Your next fight better be a world title match!

00:17:51.400 --> 00:17:53.660
Yes! Go for a world title, Miyata-

00:17:53.660 --> 00:17:54.820
Dumbass!

00:17:54.820 --> 00:17:57.470
That'll make your chances of fighting him even slimmer!

00:17:57.470 --> 00:18:01.410
Or don't you care about fighting him anymore?

00:18:01.730 --> 00:18:04.140
You're right! He can't take on the world yet.

00:18:04.140 --> 00:18:07.410
I wonder if I can go after Miyata-kun's title?

00:18:07.410 --> 00:18:08.910
He can't take on the world?

00:18:08.910 --> 00:18:10.420
He wants to go after Miyata?

00:18:10.420 --> 00:18:12.760
Who's the bozo with the big mouth?

00:18:16.270 --> 00:18:18.170
Ooh! It's Makunouchi!

00:18:18.170 --> 00:18:20.480
That's right, there's still Makunouchi!

00:18:18.170 --> 00:18:20.480
{overlap}I wanna see a Miyata-Makunouchi fight!

00:18:20.480 --> 00:18:22.720
We got our next matchup right here!

00:18:22.720 --> 00:18:24.590
Makunouchi!

00:18:24.590 --> 00:18:43.290
Makunouchi! Makunouchi! Makunouchi!{ad infinitum}

00:18:31.530 --> 00:18:33.430
Miyata!

00:18:33.430 --> 00:18:43.290
Miyata! Miyata! Miyata!{ad infinitum}

00:18:37.390 --> 00:18:40.520
<i>Of course, you must be watching somewhere out there.</i>

00:18:43.290 --> 00:18:45.330
Listen to those cheers.

00:18:45.330 --> 00:18:49.500
Of course, it's the fight everybody's dreaming about.

00:18:50.530 --> 00:18:53.320
<i>I'm glad you're all hoping for that fight.</i>

00:18:53.320 --> 00:18:56.050
<i>But I'm not the one who decides who fights.</i>

00:18:56.550 --> 00:19:01.270
<i>In any case, I look forward to having that fight the most.</i>

00:19:02.510 --> 00:19:04.260
I'm counting on you, Dad.

00:19:05.230 --> 00:19:11.530
<i>Those two men have really won the hearts of this huge crowd.</i>

00:19:12.300 --> 00:19:19.100
<i>They came a long way from being nameless trainees who sparred in the dark basement of that gym.</i>

00:19:20.830 --> 00:19:26.330
<i>Those two will surely trade punches under the bright spotlight someday.</i>

00:19:26.330 --> 00:19:30.340
<i>It will be the biggest match in the East.</i>

00:19:30.650 --> 00:19:35.760
<i>And the one who survives that fight will earn the ticket.</i>

00:19:35.760 --> 00:19:39.400
<i>One of them will earn the ticket to take on the world.</i>

00:19:43.500 --> 00:19:47.270
We will take a ten minute intermission before we start the main event,

00:19:47.270 --> 00:19:51.150
the WBC World Middleweight Championship match!

00:20:00.860 --> 00:20:04.510
It looks like my time has finally come.
